      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "When the email that dropped the comedy bomb hit the testing agency's inbox, it revealed the absurdly perfect PDF match that ruined everything. This information disclosure triggered an investigation initiation, with the agency referring its own content preparers to the national investigation bureau, resulting in a rescheduled examination for June 21—the encore nobody asked for—as arrests were made among the group.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
